        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 44368, Door Frame Mounted Security Door Hinge Pin</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis security door hinge pin installs easily in the door frame. Door Frame Mounted Security Door Hinge Pins are most often used where the hinges face the outside. An included sleeve installs into the door jamb to protect out-swinging doors even if the door hinges are tampered with by holding a closed door in place even if the hinge pins are removed or cut.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Easy to install</b>: Drill 1/2 inch hole into door frame approximately 3/4 inch deep. Push the locking Pin into door frame hole. Drill 1/2 inch hole into the door jam. Push included sleeve into jamb.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRecommend installing <b>3 to 4 security pins per door</b>, one near each door hinge.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-44368.gif?v=1704354499\" width=\"600\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Security Door Hinge Pin Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Security Door Hinge Pin Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Security Pin Length: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Security Pin Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes 1 Security Pin and 1 Sleeve</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-44368.pdf?v=1691095312\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DEL-44368 Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as Set (1 Security Pin and 1 Sleeve).</i>\r\n</p>",
